[C,docs/instructions.md,557] # Deprecations
[C,docs/instructions.md,558] 
[C,docs/instructions.md,559] The current list of deprecations includes:  
[C,docs/instructions.md,560]  - `ZeroClipboard.prototype.setHandCursor` &rarr; as of [v1.2.0-beta.4]
[C,docs/instructions.md,561]      - Use the `forceHandCursor` config option instead!
